# Prettier is here for Markdown and YAML and nothing else — the two file types
# Biome does not format. Everything Biome does format is listed here so that a
# bare `prettier --write .` cannot quietly take the JavaScript off it and start
# a formatter war in the pre-commit hook.
*.js
*.jsx
*.ts
*.tsx
*.astro
*.json
*.jsonc
*.css
